{"steam_appid":1658150,"steam_name":"Moonstone Island","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1658150/614102/0c43e24dbddd64a4550ab9e86b20c02b5a7fc3bf/1750718546/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1710698874","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256973261/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1710698874","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/2dd20a651bef6558535314a0e85d2f600d5abe7f/ss_2dd20a651bef6558535314a0e85d2f600d5abe7f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783321708","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/4ce4b478ca7098ba36961ef610b689fcda622301/ss_4ce4b478ca7098ba36961ef610b689fcda622301.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783321708","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/51c787af5f85c88759d98470c615cd318eb19fee/ss_51c787af5f85c88759d98470c615cd318eb19fee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783321708","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/35ebd1b24e58df1f6ea244e2fa4ded36dafed0f3/ss_35ebd1b24e58df1f6ea244e2fa4ded36dafed0f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783321708","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/7b6e30cc517c63caaab5fdfb6ac754ffba2829b7/ss_7b6e30cc517c63caaab5fdfb6ac754ffba2829b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783321708"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonstone Island</strong> is a creature-collecting life-sim set in an open world with 100 islands to explore. Make friends, brew potions, collect Spirits, and test your strength in card-based encounters to complete your Alchemy training! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/b10d203b7d12a24d46f0cc4204ef4feb.poster.avif?t=1783321708\" width=620 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/b10d203b7d12a24d46f0cc4204ef4feb.webm?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spend time on islands in the sky!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following your village's tradition, you must move to an island in the sky to complete your Alchemy training. Armed with a team of nature spirits, magical potions, and the support of your new friends, you'll explore ancient temples, dangerous dungeons, and hostile biomes to uncover the dark secret of Moonstone Island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/9d39ee259e0a2df0ed82b1d2a5b7a76b.poster.avif?t=1783321708\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/9d39ee259e0a2df0ed82b1d2a5b7a76b.webm?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend NPCs, become a member of the community, go on dates, fall in love, and marry the villager of your dreams!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build a new home on any of the 100 islands in your procedurally generated world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grow crops and flowers to brew potions and tame spirits. Cultivate ingredients to cook your fave dishes for fun and stat bonuses! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Customize and decorate your home to make it uniquely yours with over 300 decorations </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/478718d40c724dc5ed678084df9ce227.poster.avif?t=1783321708\" width=620 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/478718d40c724dc5ed678084df9ce227.webm?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Travel by balloon, broom, and glider through unique biomes to reach the outer edges of the world to uncover the secrets of your floating home in the sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tame and befriend wild spirits to fight alongside you - Over 70 Spirits to tame!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover and explore dungeons to earn upgrades, collect loot and uncover secrets - Or take on the INFINIDUNGEON for neverending battles and rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Optimize your character with unique skills and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft dozens of items and vehicles to prepare for the treacherous wilderness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/a15839182fff8f7be76279a8e17b284f.poster.avif?t=1783321708\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/a15839182fff8f7be76279a8e17b284f.webm?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/a15839182fff8f7be76279a8e17b284f.mp4?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since we launched on September 20, 2023 we’ve been working hard to add more functionality and fun to the game, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >41 new cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 new and free decorative items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marriage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinidungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization – Dress your alchemist up in adorable fits to reflect your play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More QoL improvements than we can count!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/0ed76c682507f4f986246f7a55a961ce.poster.avif?t=1783321708\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/0ed76c682507f4f986246f7a55a961ce.webm?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/0ed76c682507f4f986246f7a55a961ce.mp4?t=1783321708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1658150/extras/56e1f2aa026b0e1a1a0ff2987d8a0d48.avif?t=1783321708\" width=600 height=123 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 460 / Radeon HD 5850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 7 2700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / Radeon R9 280X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Studio Supersoft"],"publishers":["Raw Fury"],"release_date":"20 Sep, 2023","metacritic_score":80}